Several people have mentioned the problem of not knowing how much
weight you are carrying.  One of the problems is that trying to move
when carrying too much uses a turn (Your load is too heay to climb the
stairs... The <monster> hits... You die).

Very simple solution:  Add a weight statistic, like hit points.  It
would show the maximum weight you can carry and how much you are
currently carrying.  For example:
     HP: 35(40)  Wt: 350(500)

